    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Jump Among Stars is a challenging 3D platform game where you will face a series of escalating challenges. Each level is a thrilling adventure through an intergalactic portal to a new star system to race to the center, collect energy from the stars and return it to the space station.</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>You will need to master precision jumps, calculate the correct time, face platforms with different mechanics and find the correct path in the most diverse star systems</i></strong><br><br>The player is Lieutenant Thrina Torres of the MD-P9 troop and together with soldier Rilke H. Kenze travel to the abandoned space station Phoenix Beta 3 of the interspace organization HiperPortal to recover a capsule with the energy of a rare star.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/69fead9079a2b0ef65754b4bbdc5eef6.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/69fead9079a2b0ef65754b4bbdc5eef6.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/69fead9079a2b0ef65754b4bbdc5eef6.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Jump Among Stars the player needs to explore the Phoenix Beta 3 space station, accessing different rooms after collecting star energy. For this, the player needs to travel by teleportation to a star system, reach the main star, collect the energy...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/0be7ab2f5c5d5831e9aee1229e880725.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/0be7ab2f5c5d5831e9aee1229e880725.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/0be7ab2f5c5d5831e9aee1229e880725.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>...and reach the teleport again to return to the station.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/e532f1fb0f8f95ba61cab34e1444a2b3.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/e532f1fb0f8f95ba61cab34e1444a2b3.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/e532f1fb0f8f95ba61cab34e1444a2b3.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Each star system has a unique challenge, beautifully crafted with different platforming mechanics and challenges<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/dee30234294df1fa741ac8f41ba10777.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/dee30234294df1fa741ac8f41ba10777.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/dee30234294df1fa741ac8f41ba10777.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>While facing the 3D platforming challenges, the player can also enjoy stunningly beautiful intergalactic landscapes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/a9bbc00c2cdb2719177d02d1de753341.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/a9bbc00c2cdb2719177d02d1de753341.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/a9bbc00c2cdb2719177d02d1de753341.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game contains</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Space scenery<br></li><li> Challenges with 3D platforms<br></li><li> Different environments and scenarios to explore<br></li><li> Linear progression<br></li><li> Third-person character<br></li><li> Stories and secrets to discover<br></li><li> Immersive soundtrack<br></li><li> Beautiful 3D artwork</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Jump Among Stars is a challenging 3D platform game where you will face a series of escalating challenges. Each level is a thrilling adventure through an intergalactic portal to a new star system to race to the center, collect energy from the stars and return it to the space station.</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>You will need to master precision jumps, calculate the correct time, face platforms with different mechanics and find the correct path in the most diverse star systems</i></strong><br><br>The player is Lieutenant Thrina Torres of the MD-P9 troop and together with soldier Rilke H. Kenze travel to the abandoned space station Phoenix Beta 3 of the interspace organization HiperPortal to recover a capsule with the energy of a rare star.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/69fead9079a2b0ef65754b4bbdc5eef6.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/69fead9079a2b0ef65754b4bbdc5eef6.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/69fead9079a2b0ef65754b4bbdc5eef6.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Jump Among Stars the player needs to explore the Phoenix Beta 3 space station, accessing different rooms after collecting star energy. For this, the player needs to travel by teleportation to a star system, reach the main star, collect the energy...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/0be7ab2f5c5d5831e9aee1229e880725.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/0be7ab2f5c5d5831e9aee1229e880725.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/0be7ab2f5c5d5831e9aee1229e880725.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>...and reach the teleport again to return to the station.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/e532f1fb0f8f95ba61cab34e1444a2b3.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/e532f1fb0f8f95ba61cab34e1444a2b3.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/e532f1fb0f8f95ba61cab34e1444a2b3.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Each star system has a unique challenge, beautifully crafted with different platforming mechanics and challenges<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/dee30234294df1fa741ac8f41ba10777.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/dee30234294df1fa741ac8f41ba10777.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/dee30234294df1fa741ac8f41ba10777.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>While facing the 3D platforming challenges, the player can also enjoy stunningly beautiful intergalactic landscapes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/a9bbc00c2cdb2719177d02d1de753341.poster.avif?t=1663016026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/a9bbc00c2cdb2719177d02d1de753341.webm?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075600/extras/a9bbc00c2cdb2719177d02d1de753341.mp4?t=1663016026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game contains</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Space scenery<br></li><li> Challenges with 3D platforms<br></li><li> Different environments and scenarios to explore<br></li><li> Linear progression<br></li><li> Third-person character<br></li><li> Stories and secrets to discover<br></li><li> Immersive soundtrack<br></li><li> Beautiful 3D artwork</li></ul>",
